NOTE
Audio description for Final Fantasy VIII - Disc 2
File: disc02_12h.avi
Scene: The Ragnarok lands at Esthar
Duration: approximately 13 seconds
Describes the spacecraft landing sequence at an Esthar airfield.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
The red Ragnarok spacecraft descends through clear sky, landing gear extending downward.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.000
The sleek red spacecraft settles onto an Esthar landing pad. Engines power down with a soft hum.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Behind the Ragnarok, Esthar's futuristic cityscape rises against the horizon — towering white and metallic buildings with curved architecture, gleaming in daylight. The landing is complete. Mission accomplished.